OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds at farm building rave
OL,4,Aleads to arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after
OL,7,Fpolice disrupted what they described as
OL,8,Fan illegal rave involving a crowd of
OL,9,Fhundreds at a farm building.
OL,11,FPolice were called in the early hours
OL,12,Fto Litlington, in south Cambridgeshire,
OL,13,Fafter reports that more than 200 people
OL,14,Fwere there.
OL,16,FDispersal powers were used to prevent
OL,17,Ffurther people entering the area and
OL,18,Fmusic equipment and vehicles were
OL,19,Fseized.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
