OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds at farm building rave
OL,4,Aleads to arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man from Dunstable,
OL,7,FBedfordshire, has been charged with
OL,8,Fpossession of cannabis, failing to stop
OL,9,Fand driving otherwise than in
OL,10,Faccordance with a licence.
